&lt;li&gt;Translate complex Web3 concepts into &lt;strong&gt;simple, trustworthy user experiences&lt;/strong&gt; that make self-custody accessible without compromising on security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with legal, compliance, and risk stakeholders to navigate the evolving regulatory landscape around Web3, self-custody, DeFi, and digital assets.&lt;/li&gt;
